message: "If you use this software or its figures, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Geo-INQUIRE D6.6 figures and their inputs: integration of Trans-National Access assets into Virtual Access"
abstract: >-
  Code, registers and derived tables that regenerate the data figures (1, 3, 4, 5, 6) of
  Geo-INQUIRE Deliverable D6.6, "Mechanisms for integration of TNA assets to VA". The
  Implementation Level Matrix is the canonical record; the TA reports are read beside it
  as a reference witness.
